{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46867","headline":"寄湘中诸友 · 齐己","name":"寄湘中诸友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧云诸友尽黄眸，石点花飞更说无。\n岚翠湿衣松接院，芙蓉薰面寺临湖。\n沃洲高卧心何僻，匡社长禅兴亦孤。\n争似楚王文物国，金镳紫绶让前途。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}